    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερπόντιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			5.59
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ag.</u>
			414
		</span></i> (lyr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>over
				the sea,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθῳ δ᾽ ὑπερποντίας,</span> i.e. for
			Helen, <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				41
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιτᾶς ὑπερπόντιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					785
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάρχοντα . . ὑ.</span>
			properties <i>overseas,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(7).67.44
			</span></i> (Amorgos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>from beyond the sea,</i> i.e.<i>foreign, strange,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.</div>
